---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="GoLiveApp privacy policy — how we handle data, cookies, and third-party services.">
  <article class="policy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <p>
      GoLiveApp ("we", "us", "our") operates the website at goliveapp.net. This page explains what
      information is collected when you visit this site and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      GoLiveApp does not directly collect, store, or process any personally identifiable information.
      We do not have user accounts, contact forms, or mailing lists. No personal data is transmitted
      to our servers.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>This site uses the following third-party services, each with their own privacy practices:</p>

    <h3>Google AdSense</h3>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on
      your prior visits to this website and other sites on the internet. Google's use of advertising
      cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and
      other sites on the internet.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may opt out of personalised advertising by visiting
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>.
      You can also opt out via the
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Network Advertising Initiative opt-out page</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      For more information on how Google collects and uses data, see
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">How Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps</a>.
    </p>

    <h3>Giscus (Comments)</h3>
    <p>
      Our blog posts use Giscus for comments, which is powered by GitHub Discussions. When you
      interact with the comment section, you are using GitHub's platform and subject to
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>.
      Giscus does not set any cookies on our site.
    </p>

    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>
      GoLiveApp itself does not set any cookies. Third-party services (Google AdSense, GitHub) may
      set their own cookies in accordance with their respective privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Log Data</h2>
    <p>
      Our hosting provider may collect standard server log data (IP addresses, browser type,
      referring URLs, pages visited, time and date of visits) for security and operational purposes.
      This data is not shared with us in identifiable form.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to Other Sites</h2>
    <p>
      This site contains links to external websites, including affiliate links. We are not
      responsible for the privacy practices of those sites. We encourage you to review the privacy
      policy of any site you visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you click an affiliate link and make a
      purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate links are clearly
      marked in the relevant posts.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected by the "last
      updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the site after any changes constitutes
      acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us at
      <a href="mailto:devesh.anant@gmail.com">devesh.anant@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .policy h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .policy h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--accent2);
    margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
  .policy h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .policy p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }
  .policy a {
    color: var(--accent2);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
